@startuml
title L2-050 - Deliver reproducible setup and operational guidance
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Backend - Loupe Evaluation / Operations application" #D1FADF
participant "Documented release / restore runner" as page
participant "DeploymentConfiguration" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure and controlled runtime" #FFF4E5
participant "Production stores / workload adapters" as client
end box
note over page : Browser measurements use the production frontend in a controlled harness
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Validate required Options and compatible schema [L2-050]
alt invalid required configuration
entity --> page : Exit with safe setting name and corrective guidance
else valid required configuration
entity -> client : Run Demo workflows + separately configured live checks
client --> entity : Actual automated and manual outcomes
entity --> page : Versioned manifest and deployment/restore guidance
end
page --> actor : reproducible setup and honest release evidence
@enduml
